flowchart TD
    A([Start Matchmaker Game]) --> B[Regular Swipe Mode]
    B --> C{User swipes right?}
    C -- No --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Add profile to Liked List]
    D --> E{Reached 2 likes?}
    E -- No --> B
    E -- Yes --> F[Setup 4x4 Matchmaking Board]

    subgraph Setup [Board Setup - 16 cards]
        direction TB
        F --> G[Place 2 copies of each liked profile<br/>4 cards total]
        G --> H[Add 2 copies of 6 random profiles<br/>12 cards total]
        H --> I[Shuffle all 16 cards<br/>place face down]
    end

    I --> J[User flips two cards]
    J --> K{Do they match?}

    K -- No --> L[Strike + 1]
    L --> M{Strikes = 3?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Game Over: Lose<br/>No more message unlocks]
    M -- No --> J

    K -- Yes --> O[Match found!]
    O --> P[Unlock messaging to that <br/>specific matched profile]
    P --> Q[User sends 1 message to them]
    Q --> R[Recipient gets alert: <br/>'Someone discovered you<br/>in Matchmaker']
    R --> S{Recipient accepts?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Chat opens - both can talk]
    S -- No --> U[Chat ends - no further contact]

    O --> V{Total matches = 2?}
    V -- Yes --> W[Game Over: Win - 2 messages sent]
    V -- No --> J
